	spec: 'Message cards (sent SEND cards and received messages) use saturated hue-350 pinks on a dark pink background (OKLCH [bgL, 0.08, 0]), in terminal and web. Titles are bright hot pink [0.82, 0.18, 350]; bodies, including SEND result text, are a darker pink at similar saturation [0.62, 0.18, 350]. Fainter means darker, never desaturated. The body reaches only 4.6:1 contrast, by user choice. Themes that override message keep their own shade. Replaces the message colors in 9p.',
